      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Statement of Basis and Purpose of Executive Order.\nSection 3 of the New York City Charter provides that the\nMayor \"shall be the chief executive officer of the city.\"\nThe New York State Court of Appeals has stated that the\nMayor's authority in that capacity \"does, of course, include\nthe power to enforce and implement legislative enactments.\"\n*Under 21 v. City of New York, 65 N.Y. 2d 344, 356 (1985).*",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.3223,
          "min": -1.4554
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
